@@ -1,4 +1,9 @@
 ## Tomb Raider I-III Remastered VR Mod
+
+Fall landings retain the native leg animation at the calibrated first-person
+body size until standing IK resumes. This prevents the impact kneel from
+folding the shins through the floor. Tracked hands remain active; the landing
+camera, collision, damage and recovery timing remain native.
 
 Ordinary jumps clear any leftover body-hiding delay from an earlier landing or
 ledge transition, preventing the torso from suddenly reappearing during flight.
